	OS/8 V3D  SYSTEM REGENERATION
This tape can be used to built an OS/8 version 3D system on
a RK8E disk.  Procedure:
1)  Start up a disk and wait ten minutes for warm-up.
2)  Run RKEFMT to format the disk.
3)  Run BUILD to put a system on the disk.  Zero the system
directory.
4)  Run FOTP from this tape, and copy the contents of the
tape onto the disk.
5)  Run CCL.
6)  If desired, zero DSK:, and you are done.
